    "---\n",
    "## 7 — Zoom into the pixel grid\n",
    "\n",
    "Zoom into a small region to *see the individual pixels* and their RGB values printed on each cell."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 24,
   "id": "e7f8a9b0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json": {
